- **Icon components:** make sure `TrashIcon` and `ShareIcon` forward props to the `<svg>`. If they don't, add `aria-hidden="true"` and `focusable="false"` inside the components themselves. Set the icon size (16px) there or via CSS on `.icon-btn svg`.
- **Why I used `role="group"` instead of `role="toolbar"`:** the ARIA toolbar pattern promises arrow-key navigation with a roving tabindex. With only two buttons, plain Tab navigation is simpler and perfectly accessible. Use `role="toolbar"` only if you implement that keyboard behavior.
- **Delete is destructive:** consider a confirmation or an undo option, which helps all users, including those who activate it by accident.
